Debug.Assert(Old_arrListCount == New_arrListCount, "Old_arrListCount should be equal to New_arrListCount");

Debug.Assert(Old_arrListCount <= New_arrListCount, "New count should be greater than old count");
Debug.Assert(New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount, "New_arrListCount should be equal to Old_arrListCount");
```--------------------The following csharp code will help assert if the last position of x in new array is lesser than or equal to old array size:

